{% comment %}
  InstaMom University — the required advertising disclosure for the $1,000
  Virginia Sweepstakes.

  ⚠ NOTHING RENDERS THIS YET, ON PURPOSE. The sweepstakes is a draft: both
  pages/sweepstakes-official-rules and pages/sweepstakes-entry-form are
  unpublished until the owner supplies the legal entity name, the sweepstakes
  dates, the drawing date, the prize payment method and a contact email (search
  the page bodies for `instamom-legal__todo`).

  When the promotion is ready, go live in this order — the disclosure must not
  appear before the rules it points at, or the link 404s:
    1. fill in every placeholder in shopify/content/sweepstakes-*.html and
       re-upload both page bodies;
    2. make BOTH pages visible in the admin (Content → Pages);
    3. add `{% raw %}{%- render 'instamom-sweepstakes-disclosure' -%}{% endraw %}` wherever the
       promotion is advertised — at minimum the footer and any page or section
       that mentions the sweepstakes;
    4. add the optional entry checkbox to the cart ("Yes, enter me in the
       InstaMom University $1,000 Virginia Sweepstakes"), which is section 4 of
       the rules and is NOT built yet.

  The guard below means that even if this is rendered early it stays silent
  rather than advertising a promotion whose rules aren't reachable.

  Copy is the owner's, with the prize normalised to $1,000 (the doc used both
  $1,000 and $199 for the same prize) and the sponsor address completed.
  Styling: .instamom-sweeps-disclosure in assets/instamom.css
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign rules_page = pages['sweepstakes-official-rules'] -%}
{%- if rules_page != blank -%}
  <p class="instamom-sweeps-disclosure">
    NO PURCHASE NECESSARY. A PURCHASE WILL NOT INCREASE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING.
    Open only to legal residents of Virginia who are 18 years of age or older.
    One $1,000 prize will be awarded. Odds of winning depend on the total number
    of eligible entries received through all entry methods. Void outside
    Virginia and where otherwise prohibited. See
    <a href="{{ rules_page.url }}">Official Rules</a>. Sponsor: InstaMom
    University, 203 Boston Avenue, Lynchburg, VA 24503.
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
